ut?&quot; - When it's ready.<br /> <br /> &quot;When will that be?&quot; - OPP doesn't like giving dates until they're certain, which is usually about a week before. Right now the books are going through Indexing and Proofing, which is pretty near the end point.<br /> <br /> However if you're just ITCHING for your sweet sweet Scion content you can go <a href=\"https://scion-2nd-edition-tabletop-rpg.backerkit.com\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> and pre-order your copies, and if your preorder includes the PDFs you can get access to advanced backer rough drafts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-12T00:56:55-08:00","id":1286990,"title":"","content":"You probably already read this on the homepage, but Scion Origin and Hero are going to press this week, so soon we will have the PDFs available.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-18T21:40:42-08:00","id":1289414,"title":"","content":"The meeting notes said it was going to the presses, when in the week does it usually go on sale at drive thru.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/706-rickayelm","name":"rickayelm","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"76"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-18T23:53:01-08:00","id":1289436,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>rickayelm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1286284-release-date?p=1289414#post1289414\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The meeting notes said it was going to the presses, when in the week does it usually go on sale at drive thru.</div> </div> </div> </div>Won't be this week; they would have mentioned that.<br /> <br /> OPP releases typically go up on DriveThru on Wednesdays.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-19T00:52:39-08:00","id":1289444,"title":"","content":"I don't know why they are slow rolling this, it was supposed to come out in May 2017. If the book is done they should release it. After all we are talking about a PDF from drive thru, they don't have to ship anything the files are delivered almost instantly. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/706-rickayelm","name":"rickayelm","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"76"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-19T01:48:20-08:00","id":1289449,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>rickayelm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1286284-release-date?p=1289444#post1289444\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't know why they are slow rolling this, it was supposed to come out in May 2017. If the book is done they should release it. After all we are talking about a PDF from drive thru, they don't have to ship anything the files are delivered almost instantly. </div> </div> </div> </div>It was delayed by rewrites of the system (for the better) that happened in Trinity development. They\u2019ve discussed this in depth dozens of times.<br /> <br /> If you\u2019re a backer you should already have the preview manuscript. If you\u2019re wondering about the time gap between the preview manuscript and the public release: thy\u2019ve been doing errata and waiting for the last of the art to come in, enough text changes with the errata probably also required formatting adjustments, and then they had the index which could only be done AFTER the text was 100% done with errata and formatted since every page number needs to be set in stone.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-19T04:04:47-08:00","id":1289462,"title":"","content":"If I had a nickel for every time &quot;see page XX&quot; cropped up in a 1st edition White Wolf book, I could buy a very nice lunch.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-19T04:23:41-08:00","id":1289467,"title":"","content":"Monday meeting from yesterday/today says it\u2019s on press, so I guess maybe this week or the other...<br /> <br /> I am more worried for TC than Scion, as TC was missing much more arts than Scion on the backers preview, also missing some of the WW and OPP traditional \u201call that you need to create your character\u201d table that both Origin and Hero had on preview.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-20T07:07:06-08:00","id":1289910,"title":"","content":"Rich hinted in the comments that the KS hardcovers should start shipping in about 4 weeks, if nothing goes wrong. So, take that with a giant grain of salt.<br /> <br /> Edit: I counted wrong. Looks more like 6 weeks. Still!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":8719,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","user":"Florin","date":". 02-20-2019, 11:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-20T08:52:59-08:00","id":1289951,"title":"","content":"I just want the PDFs, as the shipping to Brazil would cost far more than the books... so i guess it will be a little earlier than the hardcovers...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-12T15:55:54-07:00","id":1296258,"title":"","content":"Now they are waing on POD proofs from drivethru, I thought they were doing a full traditional print run. Most of the time you don't do a full print run and print on demand because it is redundant.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/706-rickayelm","name":"rickayelm","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"76"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-12T19:22:53-07:00","id":1296307,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>rickayelm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1286284-release-date?p=1296258#post1296258\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Now they are waing on POD proofs from drivethru, I thought they were doing a full traditional print run. Most of the time you don't do a full print run and print on demand because it is redundant.</div> </div> </div> </div>The PoDs have nothing to do with the Kickstarted traditionally printed books going into stores. That is one of our sales venues. The PoDs are for DTRPG, which is a different sales venue we use. That\u2019s why the Monday Meeting Blog progress list includes info about both. Thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-13T15:05:53-07:00","id":1296521,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>rickayelm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1286284-release-date?p=1296258#post1296258\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Now they are waing on POD proofs from drivethru, I thought they were doing a full traditional print run. Most of the time you don't do a full print run and print on demand because it is redundant.</div> </div> </div> </div>As Rich mentioned, different venues, different books. We are selling Pugmire, Monarchies of Mau, Cavaliers of Mars, Changeling: the Lost 2e, Scarred Lands Players Guide, and Wise &amp; Wicked in both PoD and offset for retail distribution. Plus, we have books like Beast and Dark Eras that got prestige printing for KS backers with the extra copies now available for retailers to order via Indie Press Revolution...both of which are also available in PoD on DriveThruRPG.<br /> <br /> M","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Owner/Editor - FlamesRising.com","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/949-matt-m-mcelroy","name":"Matt-M-McElroy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar949_2.jpeg","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}